Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预备 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体保持笔直
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还剩10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会觉得累是因为躯干力量太弱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉不是越强壮越好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是强化锻炼啦啦队员所必须的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔能加入太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮大忙了 我也想差不多该开始练习托举了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 翔说过参加不了托举
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能参加托举
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法我还是会教的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们那照葫芦画瓢的外行练法 万一受伤可就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拜托啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托举就是阿远之前说的团体体操吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠尖子 底座 后点来组成吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也学习过了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于有啦啦队的样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 正式启动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.28,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.29,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:01.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.13,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:11.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.30,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.64,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:25.52,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.11,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:31.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:38.54,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:45.09,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:48.17,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:53.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.29,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.29,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:01.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:11.93,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.31,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.64,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:25.52,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.11,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:31.86,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:38.54,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:45.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:48.17,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:53.34,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托举包括很多技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画技好烂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比阿一还烂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土器上的画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是祈愿丰收吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重点不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管哪种表演 都少不了人塔技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要把尖子托到底座胸部高度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后高举双手 尖子站在顶端 这叫做高臂托举
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把尖子抛投到空中的动作叫做篮子抛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很考验功底的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 赶紧决定位置开始训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思拜托你们看店 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能有个室内练习场就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找地方借用一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区体育馆之类的应该能抽签借用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不贵的话哪都行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筹集部费吧 到时候还得购置{\u1}队服{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:30.50,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(897.333,618.666)}uniform
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是{\u1}中性时代{\u0}记得买中性款的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.00,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(556,622.667)}unisex
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是想说unisex这个词而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队服得花不少钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:我有个提议
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:我和翔想了一下位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:底座 一郎 弦 阿远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:后点 沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:尖子 阿晴 我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得做那个？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1}尖子{\u0}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.62,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(618.666,620)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看这{\u1}首页{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.17,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(702.667,620)}top画面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1}冠军{\u0}之争啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.17,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,620)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我拿下{\u1}杯子{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.76,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(725.333,620)}cup
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\u1}大特写{\u0}啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.63,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(662.667,620)}up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的{\u1}杯装{\u0}炒面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.47,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(685.333,620)}cup
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,hop step jump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好啊 阿晴当尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟我换吗 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 就体型来说能当尖子的只有阿一和阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于这件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 当不了尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕生 所以不喜欢出风头是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你们一个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 写真杂志吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,DREAMS 我们大学的女子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经谈妥了 下次一起训练
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同练习
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女子啦啦队啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是不是当成联谊了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想近距离看到托举
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后点的动作我还不太明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想看看底座的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口 什么时候共同训练
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两周后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 在那之前完成人塔和高臂托举
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请那边看一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女子啦啦队有正规教练
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好请人家指点一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两周时间能练会吗 翔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勉强可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 让女子啦啦队见识见识我们的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远也是吗 我也不能输啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕阿晴和阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子人气可高了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后点 用力扶稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后屈膝 利用伸展的力量靠全身的力气抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子一口气站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 翔说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一口气站起来更容易保持平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面 换班
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屈膝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用伸展的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠全身的力量 抬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双腿蹬直
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上体挺直
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没能撑住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 阿远 是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 会慢慢熟练的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我扶着 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿一 我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.62,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:只要掌握诀窍 阿晴很快就能学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和阿晴开始做一件新的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 高臂托举也已经有模有样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来 站直了 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道早就该说的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恐高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是小时候的事了吗 你平时也常去屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是不敢往下看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看大家那么努力 一直说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该道歉的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲击性的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看气氛行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后天就是共同练习了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能延期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 还有松鼠次郎老师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就请他替阿晴当一回尖子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同训练我去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没听说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去...打工
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是第一次听说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能请假吗 打什么工？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站前的...高田牧舍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从明天起要去那里打工来着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之不行 我去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙都不看？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这么回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 瘆的慌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 来客人了 快去招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来今后够呛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你这祥的笑容还怎么当啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一的妈妈以前就是啦啦队员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有阿一想成立啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些我根本都没察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就我一个人当尖子好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你请教练指导一下翻腾和动作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦：能看到小短裙也赚到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远：阿晴 明天会去的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8 GO GO DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE NO.1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大点声
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:22.56,上标,,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个在干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是约好共同练习的男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同练习？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是高城 DREAMS的OG（前队员）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是教练
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是男子啦啦队的桥本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在队里的时候还没有纯男生的啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的队名叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队名还没定 这才成立一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么 一开始不是说你们队很有实力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以共同练习对DREAMS也会有很大意义吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切从相遇的那一刻开始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没办法 既然已经答应了 就看看你们的训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才成立不久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请务必多给些建议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座 手肘不够高 再抬高些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后点别东张西望
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子 姿势不标准 胳膊伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 先下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩是什么位置的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是底座
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子...勉强算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫勉强算 你换下他试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是来训练的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 阿晴他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人塔 我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别往下看 膝盖伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股再用力些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得托举动作怎样才能稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基础稳固？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 一是基础 还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 二是技术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们男生总喜欢凭蛮力做动作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了技术 力量不足的女生也能完成得又稳又漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一点就是信任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有信任同伴 才能做到高难度技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之所以尖子敢于在高处起跳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为他相信队友一定会接住自己
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你缺少的正是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之所以站不上人塔 是因为你不信任队友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信任吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的饮料已经出了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是DREAMS的队员吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫酒井千裕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:16:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练从不会斥责没干劲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 我刚才...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本队长 之前胡扯八道的就是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯八道？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你俩怎么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来商讨下个月合作表演的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我来介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳明大学SPARKS的队长堂本和花咲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是堂本仁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是花咲薫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二位好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练 你和他们是什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是命志院男子啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队？全男生组成的啦啦队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎同志的加入
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 如果只是因为看起来光鲜想练着玩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劝你们还是放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们队每年都有好几个人退出
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队不是能闹着玩的运动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果想上进 最好还是找位老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这段时间 有教练指导吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有 今天没能来的翔...是个练过体操的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔？你是说德川翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识翔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是放弃啦啦队了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:17:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有不想被问及的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.92,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,翔：共同练习怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫上翔一起开今天的反省会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也没心情去向日葵食堂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是之前说的屋顶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说 既然有这么个地方 能不能拿来当训练场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反省会现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要说今天该反省的内容呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是没能和女子啦啦队的女生们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说和OG搞好了关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你？真的假的 话说啥叫OG
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是「额头凸起」的简称
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 辛苦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是之前说的屋顶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个话题已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说共同练习怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们 女子啦啦队...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比咱们的训练厉害多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帅气得不得了 虽然不甘心承认
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真是逊爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逊得没法看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我不够信任大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦队不是靠一个人努力就能成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管跳跃的人还是接的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有彼此信赖的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技巧才能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在失败的时候放弃 才会真的失败
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有坚持到成功的那一刻 才会成功
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是松下创始人松下幸之助说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就坚持到成功为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 拜托你以后训练再斯巴达一些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队名也该想想了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MEGANES(四眼们)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四眼就你一个好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cherry Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.49,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：樱桃(cheer)在英文的口语代表“处女”，也有“处男”的意思。\N基本上英文的情况不分男女，但日文将其加上了“boy”变成了“处男”。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是只有你一个好不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有主意 松鼠次郎s
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是不认可全男生组建啦啦队的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是那些说我们做不到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及沟口用名言隐藏的心声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远的过度缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的内疚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔内心隐藏的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有想要打破的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如不受女生欢迎的自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想打破一直以来的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破那些说我们不行的人的常识
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破我们自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏 BREAK
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKER
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定是BERAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土帅土帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就比MEGANES差那么一点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们七个一起去破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(675.133,502.047)}{\c&HD59FE5&}想要破坏的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(651.59,508.486)}{\c&HE4DB75&}想要破坏的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}想要破坏的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:25.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:29.50,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:35.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.84,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.98,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.90,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:58.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.78,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.03,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:13.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:16.50,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.09,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:23.42,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.76,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:33.27,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.40,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.23,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:43.15,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:47.78,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:35.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.84,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.18,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.64,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.98,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.90,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:58.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.78,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.03,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.49,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:13.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:16.50,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.09,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:23.42,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.76,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:33.27,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.40,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.23,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于失落成这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意料外的黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.37,0:23:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cherry Boys解散吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要在台上耍个帅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定能立刻交到一两个女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起把一切都破坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
